        <key>roleRationale</key>
        <string>Inverted R top/bottom follow the actual opposite vertical-reflected native SC roles; middle is explicitly centred between those roles. Stroked I retains the genuine SC shaft top/bottom after whole-source translation and puts middle at the actual translated defining crossbar. Side/ogonek are explicit new source positions. Native zero coordinates are not treated as inactive. All roles require actual attachment/stack review.</string>
